# SerpApi

> SerpApi provides a real-time JSON API for accessing structured search engine results from Google, Bing, Baidu, and more. Trusted by Nvidia, Shopify, Perplexity, Adobe, Samsung, KPMG, Ahrefs, Grubhub, AI21 Labs, Salesforce, Thomson Reuters, Morgan Stanley, United Nations, Experian, BrightLocal, and thousands of other companies.

- Website: https://serpapi.com
- Sign up: https://serpapi.com/users/sign_up
- API: https://serpapi.com/search
- Example: `GET https://serpapi.com/search?api_key=YOUR_API_KEY&engine=google&q=Coffee`
- Supported engines: Google, Airbnb, Apple App Store, Apple Maps, Baidu, Bing, Booking.com, Brave AI Mode, Amazon, DuckDuckGo, eBay, Facebook, Flightradar24, Instagram, Meta Ad Library, Naver, OpenTable, Search Index, The Home Depot, Target, Trader Joe's, Tripadvisor, Walmart, Yahoo!, Yandex, Yelp, YouTube, Extract, Zillow

## Pricing

- [Plans and Pricing](https://serpapi.com/pricing.md): Choose your plan. Month to month contract. Cancel anytime. SerpApi provides simple pricing to suit your every need.

## Integrations

- [Language Libraries and Tools](https://serpapi.com/integrations.md): Official libraries for Ruby, Python, JavaScript, Golang, PHP, Java, Rust, .NET, Swift, C++, and CLI, plus MCP support

## Markdown Output

- [Markdown Output for AI Agents](https://serpapi.com/markdown-output.md): Get search results as clean, token-efficient markdown instead of JSON. Built for LLMs, AI agents, and agentic workflows.
- Usage: Add `output=md` to any search request, or use `/search.md`, or request `Accept: text/markdown`

