- [Yelp Search API](https://serpapi.com/yelp-search-api.md): Scrape Yelp search results in JSON format automatically using custom parameters. Position, title, link, rating, reviews and more available.
- [Yelp Place API](https://serpapi.com/yelp-place.md): SerpApi's Yelp Place API allows you to scrape place results via the unique ID of the product. Title, text, rating, date, ID of the review alongside reviewer's basic information is served in well-structured JSON format.
- [Yelp Reviews API](https://serpapi.com/yelp-reviews-api.md): Scrape Yelp Reviews results with SerpApi's Yelp Reviews Results API. User information, rating, date, comment, owner responses and more.
- [YouTube Search API](https://serpapi.com/youtube-search-api.md): Scrape YouTube search engine video results with SerpApi's YouTube Search Engine Results API. Video titles, links, thumbnails, channels and more.
- [YouTube Video API](https://serpapi.com/youtube-video-api.md): Scrape full YouTube Video results with SerpApi's YouTube Video API. Title, description, related videos and more.
- [YouTube Video Transcript API](https://serpapi.com/youtube-video-transcript.md): Scrape YouTube video transcript with SerpApi's YouTube Video Transcript API. Video transcript text.
- [Extract API](https://serpapi.com/extract-api.md): Get the best Markdown for any URL with SerpApi's Extract API, plus page information, meta tags, structured data, links, images and media as JSON.
- [YouTube Channel API](https://serpapi.com/youtube-channel-api.md): Scrape YouTube channel videos with SerpApi's YouTube Channel API. Video titles, links, thumbnails and more.
- [Zillow Search API](https://serpapi.com/zillow-search-api.md): Scrape Zillow search results with SerpApi's Zillow Search API. Property listings, prices, and more.

## Use Cases

- [SEO](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/seo): SerpApi provides rankings and makes sense of organic search results and other search results for any domain, any keyword, any country, and any language for various search engines.
- [Local SEO](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/local-seo): By bringing SERPs Local Pack and Maps results, SerpApi allows businesses to go Local in their research and seek reliable stats to base their local marketing decisions on.
- [Web Search API](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/web-search-api): Get instant access to structured search results from Google and other major search engines. Turn raw web data into JSON or Markdown you can use for your AI applications.
- [AI Search Engine API](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/ai-search-engine-api): We help AI companies build intelligent applications by delivering real-time search results directly into AI workflows.
- [AI SEO (GEO)](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/ai-seo-geo-api): Optimize your content for Generative Engine Optimization (GEO). Track how your pages appear in AI-generated answers from places like Google AI Mode and Google AI Overview.
- [Product Research](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/product-research-tool-api): Discover and analyze products across e-commerce platforms in real time. Scrape structured data such as prices, ratings, reviews, and availability from Google Shopping, Amazon, and more.
- [Background Check Automation](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/background-check-automation): Use SerpApi to pull up information for personal or company Background Checks. All in real-time. Used by banks, law firms and law enforcement departments, among others.
- [AI Models](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/machine-learning-and-artificial-intelligence): Search results data is the best source to build large dataset for Machine Learning models. SerpApi provides multiple APIs to make these data extraction easy.
- [News Monitoring](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/news-monitoring): By utilizing News results from various search engines, SerpApi will supply you with a valuable set of data to analyze News trends, predict the future based on patterns, and monitor mentions.
- [Voice Assistant](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/voice-assistant): Building a Voice Assistant from scratch is hard. SerpApi allows a blazing fast JSON access to direct answers and knowledge graph results.
- [Price Monitoring](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/price-monitoring): Build a price monitoring tool tracking prices across e-commerce websites.
- [Travel Information](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/travel-information): Get travel information for flights, hotels, and more to build travel apps.
- [Copyright Checker Tool](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/copyright-checker-tool): Build a tool to check for copyright infringements across various platforms.
- [Cyber Threat Intelligence](https://serpapi.com/use-cases/cyber-threat-intelligence): Detect Threats, Exposed Assets, and Malicious Activity Across the Web

